d":278},"items","Items",[254,281,282,284,285,288,289,291,292,295,296,298,299,301,302,305],{},[257,283,278],{}," accepts objects or strings. Object items show ",[257,286,287],{},"label"," and bind ",[257,290,263],{},", and ",[257,293,294],{},"disabled"," disables a single item; for string items, both ",[257,297,287],{}," and ",[257,300,263],{}," are the string. With nothing selected, the bound value is ",[257,303,304],{},"''",".",[307,308],"component-example",{"name":309},"radio-group-items",[276,311,313],{"id":312},"orientation","Orientation",[254,315,316,318,319,322,323,326,327,330,331,298,334,337,338,341,342,344,345,344,347,344,350,298,353,356,357,305],{},[257,317,312],{}," defaults to ",[257,320,321],{},"auto",", switching between vertical and horizontal around ",[257,324,325],{},"breakpoint"," (default ",[257,328,329],{},"md",") by viewport width; ",[257,332,333],{},"horizontal",[257,335,336],{},"vertical"," fix the direction regardless of the viewport. When an item label is truncated, hovering or keyboard focus shows a tooltip with the full text, or a long press on touch devices (see ",[266,339,197],{"href":340},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press that shows the tooltip does not select the item. ",[257,343,312],{},", ",[257,346,325],{},[257,348,349],{},"label-key",[257,351,352],{},"value-key",[257,354,355],{},"ui"," can have site-wide defaults; see ",[266,358,360],{"href":359},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fcomponent-defaults#configurable-props","Configurable props",[307,362],{"name":363},"radio-group-orientation",[276,365,367],{"id":366},"responsive-columns","Responsive columns",[254,369,370,371,374,375,378],{},"Use ",[257,372,373],{},"orientation=\"grid\""," and override the Tailwind column and breakpoint classes with ",[257,376,377],{},"ui.fieldset",". It defaults to one column, and each row is at least as tall as an input of the same size; truncation tooltips and skeleton behavior are kept.",[307,380],{"name":381},"radio-group-grid",[254,383,384,385,387,388,391,392,395,396,398],{},"The first group is set to one column by default, two from md and four from xl. ",[257,386,325],{}," is only used for the horizontal \u002F vertical switch of ",[257,389,390],{},"orientation=\"auto\"","; grid breakpoints are controlled by the classes. ",[257,393,394],{},"class"," sets the outer frame and ",[257,397,377],{}," sets the item container. Use complete static classes so Tailwind can scan them.",[276,400,402],{"id":401},"custom-item-fields","Custom item fields",[254,404,405,406,298,408,410,411,414,415,298,417,419],{},"When the back-end item fields are not ",[257,407,287],{},[257,409,263],{}," (for example ",[257,412,413],{},"{ Code, Name }","), set them with ",[257,416,349],{},[257,418,352],{}," instead of converting the data first:",[307,421],{"name":422},"radio-group-keys",[424,425,426,445,473,497],"ul",{},[427,428,429,433,434,437,438,441,442,305],"li",{},[430,431,432],"strong",{},"The bound value must be a string",": the ",[257,435,436],{},"v-model"," type stays ",[257,439,440],{},"string",". If the back-end codes are numbers, convert them to strings first, for example ",[257,443,444],{},"items.map((item) => ({ ...item, Code: String(item.Code) }))",[427,446,447,455,456,298,458,460,461,298,464,467,468,298,470,472],{},[430,448,449,450,298,452,454],{},"The original ",[257,451,287],{},[257,453,263],{}," fields are replaced",": the component turns each object item into \"the original fields + ",[257,457,287],{},[257,459,263],{}," resolved by ",[257,462,463],{},"labelKey",[257,465,466],{},"valueKey","\". If the original data already has ",[257,469,287],{},[257,471,263],{}," fields, they are replaced by the resolved values.",[427,474,475,476,479,480,483,484,344,487,490,491,344,494,305],{},"The ",[257,477,478],{},"item"," of ",[257,481,482],{},"#item-append"," is the converted object, with both the original fields (",[257,485,486],{},"item.Code",[257,488,489],{},"item.Name",") and ",[257,492,493],{},"item.label",[257,495,496],{},"item.value",[427,498,499,500,502,503,505,506,509],{},"In development mode, when the first object item lacks the field set by ",[257,501,463],{}," or ",[257,504,466],{},", the console warns once (with the component and field names); production does not check. ",[257,507,508],{},"ShuoSelectMenu"," has the same check.",[276,511,513],{"id":512},"color","Color",[254,515,516,517,479,519,522],{},"Uses the ",[257,518,512],{},[257,520,521],{},"URadioGroup"," to change the selected color.",[307,524],{"name":525},"radio-group-color",[276,527,529],{"id":528},"size-and-states","Size and states",[254,531,532,533,536,537,540],{},"In horizontal layout, the height matches an input of the same size; the example puts a ",[257,534,535],{},"ShuoInputText"," of the same size on the right for comparison. While loading, spinners replace the radio buttons and the group is disabled. See ",[266,538,87],{"href":539},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[307,542],{"name":543},"radio-group-states",[271,545,547],{"id":546},"examples","Examples",[276,549,551],{"id":550},"item-append-content","Item append content",[254,553,554,555,559,560,562],{},"When an item needs an input right next to its label (for example \"○ Fixed amount ",[556,557,558],"span",{}," hundreds","\"), use the ",[257,561,482],{}," slot. The example selects \"Fixed amount\" when its amount input is focused:",[307,564],{"name":565},"radio-group-append",[424,567,568,574,579,589],{},[427,569,570,571,305],{},"Clicking the appended content (the input, the unit or empty space) does not change the selection; to select on focus, bind ",[257,572,573],{},"@focus=\"select\"",[427,575,576,578],{},[257,577,294],{}," already covers a disabled item, a disabled component, loading and a disabled form.",[427,580,581,584,585,588],{},[257,582,583],{},"labelId"," is the id of the item label; set it as the appended input's ",[257,586,587],{},"aria-labelledby","